WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.920
SCP-096 Vs SCP-082. The weeping, screaming&nbsp;
Shy Guy Vs the intensely talkative Fernand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.280
the Cannibal. Who would take home the&nbsp;
title belt in a fight to the death?

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.560
Both creatures are durable and&nbsp;
violent, with no qualms about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.480
murdering and potentially devouring any&nbsp;
human beings that get on their bad side.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.800
Fernand is also resistant to most forms&nbsp;
of conventional weapons, from gunfire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.200
to swords. He can also bite off a human head&nbsp;
in one bite, and go toe to toe with SCP-682.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.920
However, we’d personally&nbsp;
give this one to the Shy Guy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.360
Fernand essentially functions as&nbsp;
a larger, more dangerous human,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:42.400
and 096 can tear through literal tanks like&nbsp;
butter. The victory goes to SCP-096 on this one.

